    "updated_at": "2024-08-06T07:01:02Z",
    "body": "I'd prefer if these functions (throttle/debounce) were built-in to javascript. Limiting the eventListener call rate is useful but it's also limiting.\r\n\r\nLet's say for example i have two actions to perform when an event is triggered, one of them requires throttling and the other doesn't, that will force me to create 2 event listeners.",
